<div class="mandarin-hanzi">天气</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">tiānqì</div>

''Meaning:'' weather  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
天气很好，我们去散步。 — Tiānqì hěn hǎo, wǒmen qù sànbù. — The weather is nice; let’s go for a walk.

!! Usage note
天气 (tiānqì) describes weather. 天气怎么样？ (Tiānqì zěnmeyàng?) asks 'How is the weather?' For longer-term climate, use 气候 (qìhòu).
